        "text_UY7htX": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "color_scheme": "scheme-10",
            "title": "OUR JEWELRY",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "enable_highlight_text_color": false,
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "heading_color": "",
            "subheading": "",
            "text": "<p>Japanese Miyuki seed beads — precise enough that a bracelet reads as one continuous ribbon of colour. 18K gold vermeil over recycled sterling silver — two and a half microns of gold, thick enough for daily wear. Freshwater pearls matched by hand for lustre, so each piece is subtly one of a kind.</p><p>We repair everything we make: re-polishing vermeil and re-stringing bracelets free, for life. Jewelry this considered deserves a second act.</p>",
            "alignment": "center",
            "align_text": "left",
            "padding_left": 20,
            "padding_right": 20,
            "align_content_container": "none",
            "button_label": "",
